<title>ITALY: Espresso, Repubblica suspended.</title>
<headline>Espresso, Repubblica suspended.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's stock market authority Consob said it had suspended for Tuesday trading in shares of press publishers L'Espresso and La Repubblica pending an announcement.</p>
<p>L'Espresso, a weekly news magazine, and daily newspaper La Repubblica are both controlled by industrialist Carlo De Benedetti's industrial holding compant CIR.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
